{"text": "You think I am mad, but you should have seen how wisely I worked. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I was never kinder to the old man than during the whole week before I did it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Every night, about midnight, I turned his door handle and opened it, oh, so gently. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then I put in a dark lantern, all closed, so that no light shone out. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It took me a whole hour to put my head inside the opening. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Would a madman have been so careful. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then I opened the lantern just a crack, and a single thin ray fell upon the vulture eye. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I did this for seven long nights, but the eye was always closed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So I could not do the work, because it was not the old man who troubled me, but his Evil Eye. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And every morning I went boldly into his room and asked how he had slept.", "alignment": {"characters": ["Y", "o", "u", " ", "t", "h", "i", "n", "k", " ", "I", " ", "a", "m", " ", "m", "a", "d", ",", " ", "b", "u", "t", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "s", "h", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "h", "a", "v", "e", " ", "s", "e", "e", "n", " ", "h", "o", "w", " ", "w", "i", "s", "e", "l", "y", " ", "I", " ", "w", "o", "r", "k", "e", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "n", "e", "v", "e", "r", " ", "k", "i", "n", "d", "e", "r", " ", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "o", "l", "d", " ", "m", "a", "n", " ", "t", "h", "a", "n", " ", "d", "u", "r", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "h", "o", "l", "e", " ", "w", "e", "e", "k", " ", "b", "e", "f", "o", "r", "e", " ", "I", " ", "d", "i", "d", " ", "i", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "E", "v", "e", "r", "y", " ", "n", "i", "g", "h", "t", ",", " ", "a", "b", "o", "u"